{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Do not take her sister.</b> Both of them are as one (Kiddushin 50)." "<b>To rival.</b> Term of צָרָה — to make this one a rival to that one." "<b>In her lifetime.</b> This teaches you that if he divorced her, he may not marry her sister as long as she is alive (Yevamot 8)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:59.402308258Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}